    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0383",
      "reading_order": 500,
      "section": "5. Adjustment of Level",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.29964599999998,
        "t": 423.1359860000003,
        "r": 469.0015740000008,
        "b": 414.26426692817705
      },
      "content": "The levelling method is one of the factors to determine the degree of machine."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0384",
      "reading_order": 501,
      "section": "5. Adjustment of Level",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.299646,
        "t": 404.11602200000027,
        "r": 527.3299980000013,
        "b": 376.224338928177
      },
      "content": "Levelling the machine is the most- basic work and has an influence on the degree of the workpiece and the life of machine itself."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0385",
      "reading_order": 502,
      "section": "5. Adjustment of Level",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.299646,
        "t": 366.1362140000003,
        "r": 295.57942199999997,
        "b": 357.26449492817704
      },
      "content": "Perform levelling in the following order."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0386",
      "reading_order": 503,
      "section": "5. Adjustment of Level",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 120.540042,
        "t": 347.11625000000026,
        "r": 521.9191979999999,
        "b": 338.244530928177
      },
      "content": "Install the machine on the floor to be installed as shown in the chapter 4, \"installation\""
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0387",
      "reading_order": 504,
      "section": "5. Adjustment of Level",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 120.540042,
        "t": 328.0962860000002,
        "r": 386.3516039999993,
        "b": 319.22456692817696
      },
      "content": "Attach the level plate to the turret as shown in Fig. 4-6."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0388",
      "reading_order": 505,
      "section": "5. Adjustment of Level",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 120.540042,
        "t": 309.1364420000002,
        "r": 306.9410999999997,
        "b": 300.264722928177
      },
      "content": "Place the level above the level plate."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0389",
      "reading_order": 506,
      "section": "5. Adjustment of Level",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 120.540042,
        "t": 290.11647800000026,
        "r": 527.342022,
        "b": 243.26495092817697
      },
      "content": "Move the level much as the full feed in 2-axis (430mm 16.93in) and then read the result. At  the  time,  adjust  the  level  using  the  levelling  bolt  so  that  the  difference  from  the reading is ±0.04mm/m (±0.00157in/40in)"
    },
    {
